"},{"time":84.32,"text":"I guard, I guide and I graze"},{"time":86.96,"text":"Find a land of grass \""},{"time":89.38,"text":"The shepherd says"},{"time":92.58,"text":"\" I doubt, I count and I hunt"},{"time":94.98,"text":"I ring, I sing and I cling"},{"time":97.65,"text":"Give me wool and meat \""},{"time":100.2,"text":"The shepherd says"},{"time":102.91,"text":"\" What're you readin'  for after all?  \""},{"time":108.34,"text":"\" Kassiopeia, the star. \""},{"time":113.67,"text":"She shows the direction of fate"},{"time":117.36,"text":"Where eternal sleep spreads along"},{"time":155.79,"text":"Yodel-ay-ee-oh-ei-oh"},{"time":155.79,"text":"(\" I tend, I herd and I feed I guard, I guide and I graze)"},{"time":161.02,"text":"Diddly-odel-oh-ee-oh"},{"time":161.02,"text":"(Find a land of grass \" The shepherd says)"},{"time":166.74,"text":"Yodel-ay-ee-oh-ei-oh"},{"time":166.74,"text":"(\" I doubt, I count and I hunt I ring, I sing and I cling)"},{"time":171.7,"text":"Diddly-odel-oh-ee-oh"},{"time":171.7,"text":"(Give me wool and meat \" The shepherd says)"},{"time":177.8,"text":"\" I tend, I herd and I feed \""},{"time":180.37,"text":"The shepherd says"},{"time":188.31,"text":"\" I guard, I guide and I graze \""},{"time":191.16,"text":"The shepherd says"}]},{"title":"6 Imprinting","lyrics":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Imprinting"},{"time":4.0,"text":"曲：辻原一郎"},{"time":6.0,"text":"词：大九_LN"},{"time":8.0,"text":"调：某只泽"},{"time":10.0,"text":"唱：牧心、默辰"},{"time":12.0,"text":"绘：慧_Sophie"},{"time":19.56,"text":"I used to cry in praise of sea with stars"},{"time":27.53,"text":"So bright, so blank"},{"time":29.73,"text":"I loved how your eyes shine"},{"time":35.63,"text":"I found a dream of your stories"},{"time":42.84,"text":"Once shared with me"},{"time":47.21,"text":"But you never know"},{"time":51.42,"text":"吐露衷心只让人舌尖泛苦"},{"time":55.27,"text":"隐瞒难道才算留白的幸福"},{"time":59.19,"text":"要后退几步 要多少醒悟 足够免俗"},{"time":67.27,"text":"我们都是不擅直言的造物"},{"time":71.22,"text":"海浪没过影子来往的末路"},{"time":75.2,"te